@startuml agentic-offering-relationships
title Agentic Offering Canonical Relationships ; per CR-ES-018 §7

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic Offering" as AO

class "Offering" as O
class "Agent" as A
class "Intent" as I
class "Authority" as Auth
class "Policy" as Pol
class "Constraint" as Con
class "Agentic Product" as AP
class "Agentic Service" as AS
class "Agentic Workflow" as AW
class "Capability" as Cap
class "Outcome" as Out
class "Context" as Ctx
class "Value" as V

AO --|> O : specializes
AO --> A : engages (optional)
AO --> I : interprets
AO --> Auth : operates-within
AO --> Pol : governed-by
AO --> Con : constrained-by
AO --> AP : uses (optional)
AO --> AS : uses (optional)
AO --> AW : uses (optional)
AO --> Cap : supports
AO --> Out : produces
AO --> Ctx : adapts-to
AO --> V : contributes-to

note bottom of AO
  No foundational concept silently introduced per CR-ES-018 §7.
  Foundational Dependency Gate documented per ADR-ES-018 §16.
  Deferred concepts per ADR-ES-018 §14.
end note

@enduml
